---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Start Here | ExpositionHub"
  description="A starting point for readers exploring online business models and curated training resources."
>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start Here</p>
      <h1>Explore Online Business Models More Clearly</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        If you are researching online business models, the best first step is to
        understand the model before chasing the pitch.
      </p>
      <p>
        ExpositionHub currently highlights one featured training resource and a
        small set of supporting pages to help you evaluate whether the model is
        relevant to your goals.
      </p>
      <p class="cta-wrap">
        <a class="cta-button" href="/best/best-online-business-for-beginners">
          See the best beginner business models
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Read the guide</h2>
        <p>
          See a practical breakdown of service-based online business, affiliate
          publishing, and digital product models.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/guides/how-to-choose-your-first-affiliate-network">Read the guide</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Review the training</h2>
        <p>
          Read the current featured review before continuing to the provider page.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/reviews/passive-income-system-review">Read the review</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Featured free training</h2>
        <p>
          Ready for the direct bridge page? Continue to the featured training overview.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/free-training">View the training page</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-card,
  .panel {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.7rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #22c55e;
    color: #052e16;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #16a34a;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
